WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.917
A payment takes seconds.

00:00:02.097 --> 00:00:04.443
Understanding it can take much longer.

00:00:04.623 --> 00:00:06.640
A sudden burst of activity.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.396
An unusual amount.

00:00:08.576 --> 00:00:11.019
Records scattered across different systems.

00:00:11.199 --> 00:00:13.831
SENTINEL brings those signals together, so an

00:00:13.831 --> 00:00:16.463
analyst can see what happened—and decide what

00:00:16.463 --> 00:00:17.106
comes next.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:24.148
Follow the money, from the payment to

00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:25.391
the evidence behind it.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.854
The Command Center brings flagged payments into

00:00:30.854 --> 00:00:33.156
focus, with the context an analyst needs

00:00:33.156 --> 00:00:33.673
to begin.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.766
Open a transaction.

00:00:37.946 --> 00:00:40.482
See its payment history, risk assessment, and

00:00:40.482 --> 00:00:41.779
the case it belongs to.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.261
Here, the XGBoost model assigns

00:00:46.261 --> 00:00:48.948
a forty-six point five percent risk score.

00:00:49.128 --> 00:00:50.883
The case is synthetic.

00:00:51.063 --> 00:00:53.483
The model runs in shadow mode, supporting

00:00:53.483 --> 00:00:55.371
review rather than moving money.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.112
SHAP contributions explain which signals pushed this

00:01:00.112 --> 00:01:01.137
result up or down.

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:07.102
In this separate hosted run, Gemini completes

00:01:07.102 --> 00:01:08.480
a real investigation.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:11.380
Seven tools read the available records and

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.999
return grounded findings.

00:01:13.179 --> 00:01:15.653
Citations make the reasoning reviewable.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.509
The recommendation: request more evidence.

00:01:18.689 --> 00:01:21.355
A person still decides what happens next.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.767
Open the tool trace.

00:01:25.947 --> 00:01:27.968
See which records the agent read, and

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.935
follow a finding back to its source.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.543
Bring documents into the case, keep their

00:01:34.543 --> 00:01:36.936
provenance, and generate a reviewable P D

00:01:36.936 --> 00:01:37.461
F packet.

00:01:37.641 --> 00:01:40.542
The evidence stays connected to the investigation.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:47.162
Decision requests and independent approvals keep the

00:01:47.162 --> 00:01:48.436
next step accountable.

00:01:48.616 --> 00:01:51.313
No financial action is executed here.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:55.029
Dispute Copilot prepares a grounded response.

00:01:55.209 --> 00:01:56.711
Review the evidence.

00:01:56.891 --> 00:01:59.280
External submission stays disabled.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:02.410
In Policy Lab, adjust a threshold and

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:03.753
inspect the trade-off.

00:02:03.933 --> 00:02:05.867
Review the ROC and precision

00:02:05.867 --> 00:02:09.412
recall analysis against held-out synthetic data, before

00:02:09.412 --> 00:02:11.217
considering a policy change.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:15.507
Risk Monitoring compares activity and score distributions

00:02:15.507 --> 00:02:16.096
over time.

00:02:16.276 --> 00:02:18.582
A shift is a reason to investigate,

00:02:18.582 --> 00:02:19.504
not a verdict.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:24.167
Relationship Explorer connects payers and payments.

00:02:24.347 --> 00:02:27.262
Select a relationship, inspect the recorded history,

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:29.111
and bring the context back to the

00:02:29.111 --> 00:02:29.391
case.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.250
Earlier audits verified a genuine PayPal sandbox

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.769
capture and processed Supabase events.

00:02:35.949 --> 00:02:38.226
These recorded results are separate from this

00:02:38.226 --> 00:02:39.339
synthetic walkthrough.

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:43.215
SENTINEL.

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:46.455
Detection, explanation, and investigation.

00:02:46.635 --> 00:02:48.164
One connected view.

00:02:48.344 --> 00:02:50.350
Human judgment at the center.
